{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9ca79dbcd2e91bbeab29fcd268044a1fee8aee26135e5cdb4abceb97172d98ca", "ja": "（茜のプロモ用撮影が終わった。予想外の\nハプニングもあったが、無事に終わってよかった！）", "zh": "（茜的宣传拍摄结束了。虽然发生了意料之外的意外，但能顺利结束真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "c794ae461cdfa8164f63ab72630984f3e55257f8cf2ff98a8fe97884bf9ba102", "ja": "フゥ、困ったね{$P$}ちゃん……。\nまた茜ちゃんの魅力が、全世界に知れ渡っちゃうよ！", "zh": "呼，真伤脑筋啊，{$P$}……  \n又要让全世界都知道小茜的魅力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f3972e538b5ad68d5443896fa5134d6c6fb1d835aefa35e3e8880397abaaa6bf", "ja": "ああ、いい感じだったな！\n雨のせいで、一時はどうなる事かと思ったけど。", "zh": "啊，感觉不错啊！\n虽然因为下雨，一度还真担心会变成什么样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "f2d21f2512ea7455dc02dd694059ea0de4000b143727b620571c4c61c445bb64", "ja": "ウニャッ！？　そ、それは……茜ちゃん的に\n超反省点というか、忘れて欲しい大失態というか……！", "zh": "呜喵！？那、那是……从小茜的角度来说，\n算是超级需要反省的地方，或者说是希望你忘掉的大失误……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "6df21c7bbe07f194d973f0a85a0dff6a5a0855a0876deb01153bf3fe196393eb", "ja": "で、でも、撮影は大成功だったし！\n結果オーライでしょ？　ね？", "zh": "但、但是，拍摄大获成功嘛！\n结果好就行了吧？对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a3c5cea95e85a3193395b17c9f547374a74332b2370ad0446002d4dba40d7115", "ja": "まあな……でも、危ないところだったんだぞ？\nたまたま替えの衣装があったからよかったものの。", "zh": "嗯……不过，刚才可真是够危险的啊？\n幸好碰巧有替换用的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "86e54f7db0d061baad3b39fb38a4db8f9c322eccaad4489df976860f2e801a8c", "ja": "それは茜ちゃん、反省してます！\n衣装のままうろつくのは、ほどほどにしないとって。", "zh": "那是小茜，我已经反省了！\n不能穿着演出服到处乱逛，还是得适可而止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "153fa8a7e02c4eb8a1157290f04d892cd2f15ebcab1ea0b728fcc211dc1822aa", "ja": "ホント、ホントだってば！　だから茜ちゃんも、\nこんな格好での撮影、OKしたんだし。", "zh": "真的，真的啦！所以小茜也同意让我穿成这样拍摄嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1008_p", "source_sha256": "265b856694e7f61bebf464b0d58000d749af4bef0a7cf85dae73270a17ebea91", "ja": "こんな格好って……そんなに嫌だったのか？\n結構ノリノリだったと思ったのに。", "zh": "这种打扮……你原来那么讨厌啊？\n我还以为你挺乐在其中的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "1ee551c7473344316ee386969d810de9511edd49b79033b086254cf0c78f8d1f", "ja": "い、いやまあ、正直楽しかっ……ちっがーう！\nそういう話じゃなくて！　雰囲気が全然違うしね！", "zh": "不、不是，怎么说呢，老实讲其实挺开心的……不对——！  \n不是在说这个！感觉完全不一样嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "c0bdf04281a229837d5a19042c000f8d4d9ec2355865452c1fa518fc8e9b71c2", "ja": "こういうお嬢様っぽいイメージで撮影するのは、\n本来の茜ちゃんのブランディングから遠いのです！", "zh": "用这种大小姐风格的形象来拍摄，和真正的小茜品牌定位相去甚远！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "32222b8799c61c37d7b85613e00c34848689fddc42fdec5f5feba06c015c0b24", "ja": "ほら、茜ちゃんのウリといえば弾けるようなこの笑顔！\n明るさとユニークさが持ち味のアイドルだもんね。", "zh": "看嘛，要说小茜的卖点，那就是这灿烂得仿佛要迸发出来的笑容！毕竟是以开朗和独特为特点的偶像嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0c7c828428c5d71ba0e48c9abb64ad3173515bbfbc350d274e707156ed0b0f2f", "ja": "ユニークって、自分で言うのか。\nまあ、わからなくもないけど……。", "zh": "独特这种话，你自己说得出口啊。\n不过，也不是不能理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b58ce8b28f86936e9faed2a8ef0bbf04874f0a3dfc8928466f4cc8420e2d92d", "ja": "うんうん。だからこれは、特別仕様！\nめったに見られない、SSRな茜ちゃんなんだよ。", "zh": "嗯嗯。所以这是特别规格！\n这是难得一见的SSR级小茜哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1014_p", "source_sha256": "756f67eb9c4e06d4b67d9b6fe227d704f5aa2bd6416ec7a35a2554cea5c9bd4a", "ja": "そうか……茜がそう言うなら仕方ないけど。\n……ちょっと残念だな。", "zh": "这样啊……既然茜都这么说了，那也没办法。\n……还是有点遗憾啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "08bb5fb3e1c5386ddb623ae77796698a79feb71dc6b24ec279168c856c205d79", "ja": "え？　{$P$}ちゃん……？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "082e0d990a1e8523b9224ca77f646d7d559be2abd0220b437d3c61a1ede3e8e9", "ja": "今みたいな茜、もっと見たいなと思ったから。\nファンにも受けると思うぞ。", "zh": "因为我觉得，像刚才那样的茜，我还想多看一些。\n我觉得粉丝们也会喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "c3366eb8e1ab7071381facf07e2e04e3f78e8791e3699bacad1367d552841d25", "ja": "え、えっと……見たい？　ホント？\nだけど、元々みんなに見せようと思ってた姿とは……。", "zh": "诶、那个……想看？真的？\n可是，这和我原本打算让大家看到的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5d6b759b89359151d89390a6bb57605ab62b184ae45b0343c2f7a1c943e2916f", "ja": "うん。予定とは違ったかもだけど、それも茜だし。\n新しい魅力を見つけるのも、ブランディングだと思う。", "zh": "嗯。虽然可能和预定的不太一样，但这也是茜啊。\n而且我觉得发现崭新的魅力，同样是一种塑造品牌的过程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "225818d1ecd846a7cdd67868be6ab2c769a7ae9ab5a6a13e33f2214a22884cf2", "ja": "く、くううっ、おのれ……！\nそ、そこまで言うなら仕方ない！　いいだろうっ！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……可恶……！\n既、既然你都这么说了，那就没办法了！好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8967b146e9717ed4190affbaabd20ef99165fb6ef3327d2f573396b70f48874", "ja": "それで茜ちゃんの新たな魅力が伝わるなら、\n{$P$}ちゃんに方針をゆだねよう。", "zh": "这样一来，如果能让大家感受到小茜全新的魅力，就把方针交给{$P$}来决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0264_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "172d4a6df1ca151d7290f21a3407b2306ffc54a22734c50a3f9d7219a4eee75c", "ja": "その代わり……これからも茜ちゃんがミスをしたら、\nしっかりフォローしてね？　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "不过作为交换……今后如果小茜犯错了，也要好好帮忙补救哦？喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
